OL,3,GNEWSAUnsolved mystery of the body in
OL,4,Athe railway tunnel
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn the night of 24 September 1905 a
OL,7,Frailway inspector walked through the
OL,8,FMerstham Tunnel in Surrey to make a
OL,9,Froutine inspection.
OL,11,FHe might have been checking for
OL,12,Fobstructions on the line, or whether
OL,13,Fthe tracks were in good repair, but
OL,14,Fwhat he found was the dead body of a
OL,15,Fyoung woman.
OL,17,FMary Money, 21, had met a gruesome end
OL,18,Fin mysterious circumstances that are
OL,19,Fstill unsolved to this day.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
